,1],[0,"All right, that's not too bad.","Gerai, ne taip jau blogai.","3f47d141fe03",2.06],[0,"Do you want us to start without you?","Ar norite, kad pradėtume be Jūsų?","78975a127eff",2.11],[-1,"Can I join online?","Ar galiu prisijungti nuotoliniu būdu?",1],[0,"Sure, I'll send you the link.","Žinoma, atsiųsiu Jums nuorodą.","b7156a345399",1.84],[0,"Should we start without you?","Ar pradėti be Jūsų?","e949c98eae6b",1.39],[-1,"What does that mean?","Ką tai reiškia?",1],[0,"Here, let me explain.","Tuoj paaiškinsiu.","1b6e0d595c34",1.81],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[0,"Sure, we can wait a few minutes.","Žinoma, galime kelias minutes palaukti.","8b22591b4375",2.14],[0,"Thanks for calling. See you soon!","Ačiū, kad paskambinote. Iki greito!","da43c005d65d",1.85],[0,"Good morning, Harris speaking.","Labas rytas, Harisas klauso.","aea65bc3c856",1.6],[0,"Ah, hi there!","A, sveiki!","ca27c80cbaf7",1.25],[0,"What can I do for you?","Kuo galiu padėti?","046f6ffcc9f1",1.26],[-1,"I'm running late.","Aš vėluoju.",1],[0,"What happened?","Kas atsitiko?","b853ca69410c",0.82],[-1,"My alarm didn't go off.","Nesuskambo žadintuvas.",1],[0,"Ha! It happens to everyone.","Cha! Taip nutinka visiems.","290aa4594726",2.48],[0,"What time will you be here?","Kelintą valandą būsite čia?","d922d1f3663c",1.46],[-1,"In about half an hour.","Maždaug po pusvalandžio.",1],[-1,"No, I'm good, thanks.","Ne, man nereikia, ačiū.",1],[0,"Hmm, okay. We'll start without you, then.","Hmm, gerai. Tada pradėsime be Jūsų.","454b69926252",3.39],[0,"How can I help?","Kuo galiu padėti?","25d1df5896f3",1.11],[-1,"I missed the bus.","Nespėjau į autobusą.",1],[0,"Oh, that's annoying.","O, kaip nemalonu.","507bb60ce2bb",1.3],[-1,"I'm almost there.","Jau beveik esu vietoje.",1],[0,"Great.","Puiku.","14ecc4f4a071",0.51],[0,"No problem. We'll start without you.","Jokių problemų. Pradėsime be Jūsų.","3e0a14d7c24e",2.17],[-1,"Sorry for the trouble.","Atsiprašau dėl nepatogumų.",1],[0,"It's okay. These things happen.","Nieko tokio, taip nutinka.","611052be0ea4",2.24],[-1,"I had to take my son to the doctor.","Turėjau nuvežti sūnų pas gydytoją.",1],[0,"Of course. Family comes first.","Žinoma. Šeima svarbiausia.","daa3bedace4d",2.61],[0,"My pleasure!","Mielai!","8dcc61818139",0.81],[-1,"Thanks for your help!","Ačiū už pagalbą!",1],[0,"You're welcome!","Prašom!","c2bf2187f62e",0.84],[-1,"Goodbye!","Viso gero!",1],[0,"Bye!","Iki!","c6539de248ee",0.5],[-1,"Could you speak more slowly, please?","Ar galėtumėte kalbėti lėčiau?",1],[0,"Of course. I'll say it slowly.","Žinoma. Pasakysiu lėtai.","570091b915b4",2.46],[-1,"Could you save me a seat?","Ar galėtumėte palikti man vietą?",1],[0,"Okay, we'll get started, then.","Gerai, tada pradėsime.","ae432faec189",2.04],[0,"Of course. I'll save you a seat.","Žinoma. Paliksiu Jums vietą.","3c34e5c5bc88",2.22],[0,"Okay, see you soon.","Gerai, iki greito.","65bacbac2fd5",1.71],[-1,"Sorry, I don't understand.","Atsiprašau, nesuprantu.",1],[0,"No problem. I'll say it again, more slowly.","Jokių problemų. Pakartosiu lėčiau.","a5bbdc0cf971",2.94],[-1,"Could you tell the team?","Ar galėtumėte pasakyti komandai?",1],[0,"Sure, we'll start without you.","Žinoma, pradėsime be Jūsų.","4a6b62742a4f",2.15],[0,"Sure, I'll tell them.","Žinoma, pasakysiu jiems.","cfbd78c7372d",1.29],[0,"What's up?","Kas nutiko?","fc8bdb07c193",0.66],[0,"Oh no! That's the worst.","O ne! Blogiau nebūna.","e84e938f5a92",2.54],[-1,"I'll be there in twenty minutes.","Būsiu po 20 minučių.",1],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[-1,"I overslept.","Pramiegojau.",1],[0,"Oh, that happens.","O, taip būna.","179a0d9cc4c6",1.39],[-1,"Have a nice day!","Geros dienos!",1],[0,"See you soon. Bye!","Iki greito! Viso gero!","33501bbf170f",1.58],[0,"How long do you think you'll be?","Kiek, Jūsų manymu, užtruksite?","eb4bff39eca6",1.76],[-1,"I'll be there by nine thirty.","Būsiu iki 9:30.",1],[-1,"Sure, thanks!","Žinoma, ačiū!",1],[0,"I know, the roads are really busy today.","Žinau, šiandien keliuose